<section class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 py-16">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-6 text-center">How to Download Internet Archive Videos</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 text-center mb-10">Last updated: 2026</p>

    <div class="prose dark:prose-invert max-w-none">
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
        The Internet Archive is a nonprofit digital library offering millions of free books, movies, music, and websites. Many videos on archive.org are in the public domain or under Creative Commons, making them safe to download and reuse.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-8 mb-4">Finding public domain movies</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Archive.org has dedicated collections for public domain films, classic cartoons, old TV shows, and educational videos. Each item page shows the license, so you can confirm whether reuse is allowed before downloading.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-8 mb-4">Step-by-step guide</h2>
      <ol class="list-decimal pl-6 space-y-2 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
        <li>Go to archive.org and find the video you want.</li><li>Copy the item URL, for example https://archive.org/details/filename</li><li>Paste the link into ClipVault and click Get Video.</li><li>Wait for the available formats to appear.</li><li>Choose MP4, AVI, or OGG and download.</li>
      </ol>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-8 mb-4">Helpful tips</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
        <li>Check the license on the item page before reusing.</li><li>Older formats like AVI may be larger; MP4 is usually the best choice.</li><li>Use the Internet Archive's collections to discover rare content.</li><li>Credit archive.org and the original uploader when sharing.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-8 mb-4">Legal and safety reminder</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Only download content you created, own, or have explicit permission to use. Respect copyright, platform terms, and local laws. For more details, read our <a href="/content-policy" class="text-sky-600 dark:text-sky-400 hover:underline">Content Policy</a>.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-8 mb-4">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
