          <p class="mt-3 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 text-sm">No, some have specific licenses. Always check the item page.</p>
        </details>
        
        <details class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-4">
